<title>POLAND: IRENA SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 0.97 MLN.</title>
<headline>IRENA SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 0.97 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.97 vs   0.49</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.39 vs   0.51</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.11 vs   0.05 loss</p>
<p> Sales		    5.60 vs   4.25</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.86 vs   5.40</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 6.71 vs   7.48</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.06 vs   3.59</p>
<p> Sales		   42.14 vs  38.86</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish glass maker is HSG Irena SA. The</p>
<p>company said it had deducted 324,300 zlotys from income tax in</p>
<p>Sepember, compared to 200,000 zlotys in September last year. It</p>
<p>also put aside 128,000 zlotys as reserve for a possible future</p>
<p>income tax payment, compared to 20,200 zlotys in the same period</p>
<p>last year.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
